":3,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1004,"name":"席摩","rawName":"席摩","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"시모"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_simo#3","rawText":"所以……這一次我沒有辦法幫助教授……但是請放心，在教授尋找記憶的期間，我會負責保護好綠洲的。","displayText":"所以……這一次我沒有辦法幫助教授……但是請放心，在教授尋找記憶的期間，我會負責保護好綠洲的。","spans":[{"text":"所以……這一次我沒有辦法幫助教授……但是請放心，在教授尋找記憶的期間，我會負責保護好綠洲的。"}]}],"next":"24carnival_simo#4"},"24carnival_simo#4":{"id":"24carnival_simo#4","act":4,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_simo#4","rawText":"席摩……嗯，我知道了。我會儘快恢復記憶的。不過，有一點你說錯了哦，你已經幫助過我了。","displayText":"席摩……嗯，我知道了。我會儘快恢復記憶的。不過，有一點你說錯了哦，你已經幫助過我了。","spans":[{"text":"席摩……嗯，我知道了。我會儘快恢復記憶的。不過，有一點你說錯了哦，你已經幫助過我了。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":104,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"alpha":1,"isDark":true}]},"next":"24carnival_simo#5"},"24carnival_simo#5":{"id":"24carnival_simo#5","act":5,"kind":"narration","units":[{"uid":"24carnival_simo#5","rawText":"我將一塊小小的面具碎片放到了席摩的手心上。","displayText":"我將一塊小小的面具碎片放到了席摩的手心上。","spans":[{"text":"我將一塊小小的面具碎片放到了席摩的手心上。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":104,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"alpha":0,"isDark":true}]},"next":"24carnival_simo#6"},"24carnival_simo#6":{"id":"24carnival_simo#6","act":6,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"heroId":1004,"name":"席摩","rawName":"席摩","isProfessor":false,"lookup":"시모"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_simo#6","rawText":"這是……","displayText":"這是……","spans":[{"text":"這是……"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":104,"delay":0,"duration":0.2,"alpha":1,"isDark":false}]},"next":"24carnival_simo#7"},"24carnival_simo#7":{"id":"24carnival_simo#7","act":7,"kind":"dialogue","speaker":{"name":null,"rawName":"bravo","isProfessor":true,"professorVariant":"bravo","lookup":"bravo"},"units":[{"uid":"24carnival_simo#7","rawText":"這是你過去為保護綠洲而戰時，遺留在戰場上的一塊破損的面具。","displayText":"這是你過去為保護綠洲而戰時，遺留在戰場上的一塊破損的面具。","spans":[{"text":"這是你過去為保護綠洲而戰時，遺留在戰場上的一塊破損的面具。"}]}],"stageRaw":{"imgTween":[{"imgId":104,"delay":0,"d